 1.2 Data Model Definition

 File: pkg/controller/provider/model/nutanix/model.go (NEW)

 Create core data structures following vSphere pattern:
 - Base struct (ID, Name, Parent, Revision)
 - Cluster - Nutanix cluster metadata
 - Host - AHV hypervisor nodes
 - Network - Nutanix subnets/VLANs
 - StorageContainer - Nutanix storage containers
 - VM - Virtual machine details with NICs, disks, guest tools
