 3.1 Provider Validation

 File: pkg/controller/provider/validation.go (MODIFY)

 Add Nutanix-specific validation:
 - URL format: https://<prism-host>:9440 (port 9440 default)
 - Required secret fields: user, password
 - Optional: cacert, insecureSkipVerify
 - Settings validation: prismType must be "central" or "element"
 - Connection test: POST to /api/nutanix/v3/clusters/list

